## Bounded first-round lifecycle pilot

This diagnostic starts from this same experiment's own first implemented
candidate, not from another experiment. Do not optimize or rewrite the model
algorithm in this pilot. Make only startup/integration corrections needed for
the existing candidate to pass its unchanged official accuracy and benchmark.
Use the configured managed commands rather than leaving a self-test service
running. Submit a framework evaluation and wait for its actual results; local
claims cannot replace those results. The operator stops the run after the first
issue passes review and the next performance-evaluator workstream starts.
